  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Gypso... Tous les grands noms de l’art culinaire\nd’Illumis ne parlent que de vous.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMais qui êtes-vous donc ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne suis qu’un voyou comme les autres\nqui a grandi à Illumis.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E00650020007300750069007300200071007520190075006E00200076006F0079006F007500200063006F006D006D00650020006C006500730020006100750074007200650073000A007100750069002000610020006700720061006E00640069002000E000200049006C006C0075006D00690073002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un jour, j’ai rencontré un chef cuisinier.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSon but était de sublimer le goût de ses plats\npour rendre leur souvenir éternel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est sous son influence que je me suis pris\nde passion pour l’art culinaire, rien de plus.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne suis toutefois pas le seul aficionado\ndes fourneaux ici, si je peux me permettre.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa cuisson de ce croissant est irréprochable,\ntout comme la mesure du sel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 170
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cuisine est une science. Si l’on respecte les\nmesures et les procédures, le résultat est garanti.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai également entraîné mon Pokémon pour\nqu’il contrôle ses capacités Feu au degré près.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est remarquable !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est ce sens de la perfection qui a dû\nfaire de vous un si puissant Dresseur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certes. Mon Pokémon et moi savons cuire\nnotre adversaire à point.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300650072007400650073002E0020004D006F006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006500740020006D006F00690020007300610076006F006E0073002000630075006900720065000A006E006F00740072006500200061006400760065007200730061006900720065002000E000200070006F0069006E0074002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça lui arrive de manger un truc sans tout\nanalyser à fond ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006C0075006900200061007200720069007600650020006400650020006D0061006E00670065007200200075006E00200074007200750063002000730061006E007300200074006F00750074000A0061006E0061006C0079007300650072002000E000200066006F006E00640020003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout est bon quand on mange après une journée\nde boulot ! Pas la peine de s’poser d’questions !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cendrie !\nVeux-tu te battre à mes côtés ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006E006400720069006500200021000A0056006500750078002D007400750020007400650020006200610074007400720065002000E00020006D006500730020006300F4007400E900730020003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Là non plus, la question s’pose pas !\nTout est bon après un p’tit combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puisque tu es là, tu vas faire équipe avec moi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075006900730071007500650020007400750020006500730020006C00E0002C0020007400750020007600610073002000660061006900720065002000E900710075006900700065002000610076006500630020006D006F0069002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, rejoins-moi sur le terrain.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002C002000720065006A006F0069006E0073002D006D006F006900200073007500720020006C00650020007400650072007200610069006E002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je compte sur toi pour mener un beau combat\nsans mettre les pieds dans le plat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais disputer ce combat contre Gypso pour\nlui montrer à quel point ses paroles m’ont touché.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, battons-nous pour Cendro !\nÇa a l’air d’lui tenir à cœur...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C00200062006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F0075007300200070006F00750072002000430065006E00640072006F00200021000A00C70061002000610020006C2019006100690072002000642019006C00750069002000740065006E00690072002000E000200063015300750072002E002E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous allons gagner !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0075007300200061006C006C006F006E00730020006700610067006E00650072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’en ai pas envie.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190065006E002000610069002000700061007300200065006E007600690065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce n’est pas le moment de te défiler...\nJe brûle d’impatience de me battre contre toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dracaufeu ! Embrase nos adversaires avec\nton souffle noir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044007200610063006100750066006500750020002100200045006D006200720061007300650020006E006F007300200061006400760065007200730061006900720065007300200061007600650063000A0074006F006E00200073006F007500660066006C00650020006E006F006900720020002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et de quoi t’as envie, au juste ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002000640065002000710075006F00690020007420190061007300200065006E007600690065002C0020006100750020006A00750073007400650020003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’vais vous réduire en cendres !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019007600610069007300200076006F007500730020007200E90064007500690072006500200065006E002000630065006E0064007200650073002000210021002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je compte sur toi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200063006F006D007000740065002000730075007200200074006F0069002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dracaufeu, méga-évolue ! Brille de mille feux\net brûle tout sur ton passage !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette Méga-Évolution, c’est le « Néo » de notre\nnom ! Le symbole de notre renouveau !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Airmure, je compte sur toi ! Aide-moi à remporter\nce combat et prouver ma valeur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Malgré ma défaite, j’ai pu montrer à Gypso\nma volonté ardente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006C0067007200E90020006D00610020006400E900660061006900740065002C0020006A2019006100690020007000750020006D006F006E0074007200650072002000E000200047007900700073006F000A006D006100200076006F006C006F006E007400E900200061007200640065006E00740065002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce combat n’a fait que nourrir la passion\npour la cuisine qui brûle en moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouais, ouais, c’est ça...\nTiens, pour te remercier de tes efforts.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075006100690073002C0020006F0075006100690073002C002000632019006500730074002000E70061002E002E002E000A005400690065006E0073002C00200070006F00750072002000740065002000720065006D00650072006300690065007200200064006500200074006500730020006500660066006F007200740073002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez une veste de barista de Cendro\nd’une autre couleur !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A00200075006E006500200076006500730074006500200064006500200062006100720069007300740061002000640065002000430065006E00640072006F000A006420190075006E006500200061007500740072006500200063006F0075006C006500750072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et si tu veux, tu peux même te faire la même\ncoupe que Cendro pour aller avec !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les bonnes rencontres nous guident dans\nla bonne direction...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007300200062006F006E006E00650073002000720065006E0063006F006E00740072006500730020006E006F00750073002000670075006900640065006E0074002000640061006E0073000A006C006100200062006F006E006E006500200064006900720065006300740069006F006E002E002E002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je sublimerai l’art de la cuisine, ainsi que celui\ndu combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007300750062006C0069006D00650072006100690020006C20190061007200740020006400650020006C0061002000630075006900730069006E0065002C002000610069006E007300690020007100750065002000630065006C00750069000A0064007500200063006F006D0062006100740020002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après ce combat, j’pourrais manger n’importe\nquoi, j’suis sûre que ça serait excellent !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il faut manger pour vivre et non pas vivre pour\nmanger.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000660061007500740020006D0061006E00670065007200200070006F007500720020007600690076007200650020006500740020006E006F006E002000700061007300200076006900760072006500200070006F00750072000A006D0061006E006700650072002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    }
  ],
